<rich_text>CWES is a 7-day web pentest: several real-world apps, flags as you find bugs (~10 flags, pass at 8), plus a commercial-grade report. People who have taken it say the exam labs are harder than the course and need chained attacks and a lot of enumeration.</rich_text>
