<node name="Exam" unique_id="316" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#ec5651" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h1" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Your workspace for exam days: apps, findings, flags and a log for each day. Every table here matches a part of the </rich_text>
<rich_text link="webs https://docs.sysreptor.com/assets/reports/HTB-CWES-Report.pdf" foreground="#ec5651">official CWES report template</rich_text>
<rich_text>, so by the end most of the report is already written down.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#e03131">Keep this file private
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Once you start the exam, this file holds exam content. Don't push it to a public GitHub repo or share it, during or after the exam. HTB's terms don't allow it. To lock it with a password, use </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Save As</rich_text>
<rich_text> and pick a </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Password Protected</rich_text>
<rich_text> storage type (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">.ctx</rich_text>
<rich_text> or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">.ctz</rich_text>
<rich_text>).</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Start here</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>1. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 317" foreground="#ec5651">01 - Before You Start</rich_text>
<rich_text>: go through the checklist before you start.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>2. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 318" foreground="#ec5651">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>: copy the scope from the letter of engagement.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>3. Keep a log as you work: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Log</rich_text>
<rich_text> has one node per exam day, from </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 324" foreground="#ec5651">Day 01</rich_text>
<rich_text> to </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 330" foreground="#ec5651">Day 07</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Apps</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>One node per item under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Apps</rich_text>
<rich_text>. Start with </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 322" foreground="#ec5651">App 1</rich_text>
<rich_text> and rename it. For each new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › App</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Apps</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Tracking</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 319" foreground="#ec5651">03 - Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every vulnerability worth reporting. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Summary of Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 320" foreground="#ec5651">04 - Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every flag and where it came from. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Flags Discovered</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#ec5651">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<encoded_png char_offset="0" justification="left" link=""></encoded_png>
<node name="01 - Before You Start" unique_id="317" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwes exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Setup</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>VPN connects and you can reach the first target</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot tool ready (Flameshot or similar). Paste each screenshot straight into the host's node with </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot names picked, like </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">web01-03-shell.png</rich_text>
<rich_text> (item, step, what it shows), so you can find each one when you write the report</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Terminal logging on (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">tmux</rich_text>
<rich_text> logging or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ec5651">script</rich_text>
<rich_text>) so you keep every command and its output</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Report started from the HTB CWES template in SysReptor</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Autosave and backups on: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Preferences › Miscellaneous</rich_text>
<rich_text>, tick </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Autosave Every x Minutes</rich_text>
<rich_text> and </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Create a Backup Copy Before Saving</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>A copy of this file kept somewhere private. Only open it in one CherryTree window at a time, or you can lose changes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Read</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Letter of engagement read twice, scope copied into </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 318" foreground="#ec5651">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Exam start time, end time and report deadline written down</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>What counts as a flag and how to submit it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Plan</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Rough plan for each day, with real breaks</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Sleep plan. Long exams are lost to fatigue more often than to missing skills.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Wordlists and tools ready on your attack box</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 316" foreground="#ec5651">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#ec5651">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
</node>
<node name="02 - Scope &amp; Rules" unique_id="318" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwes exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">In Scope Assets</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">copy these from the letter of engagement; the report has the same table</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Out of Scope</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. A host the letter says not to touch</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Rules of Engagement</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. No denial of service</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Timeline</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 316" foreground="#ec5651">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#ec5651">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="88" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="200,173"><row><cell>e.g. www.example.htb</cell><cell>e.g. Main website</cell></row><row><cell>Host/URL/IP Address</cell><cell>Description</cell></row></table>
<table char_offset="206" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="110,240"><row><cell>Exam start</cell><cell>e.g. 2026-11-01 09:00 UTC</cell></row><row><cell>Exam end</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>Report due</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>Item</cell><cell>Date and time</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="03 - Findings" unique_id="319" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwes exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>Write every finding here as you go, then write each one up properly in the report. A finding can be on the attack path or standalone.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Each finding needs</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>In the report, every finding has: CWE, CVSS 3.1, Root Cause, Impact, Remediation, References and Finding Evidence.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">Severity</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 316" foreground="#ec5651">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#ec5651">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="135" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="60,161,148,178,178,178"><row><cell>e.g. 1</cell><cell>e.g. the vulnerability</cell><cell>e.g. the host or app</cell><cell>e.g. High, Medium, Low or Info</cell><cell>e.g. yes once the screenshot is saved</cell><cell>e.g. yes once it's written up</cell></row><row><cell>#</cell><cell>Finding</cell><cell>Where</cell><cell>Severity</cell><cell>Evidence ready</cell><cell>In report</cell></row></table>
<table char_offset="282" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="92,164"><row><cell>Critical</cell><cell>9.0 to 10.0</cell></row><row><cell>High</cell><cell>7.0 to 8.9</cell></row><row><cell>Medium</cell><cell>4.0 to 6.9</cell></row><row><cell>Low</cell><cell>0.1 to 3.9</cell></row><row><cell>Info</cell><cell>0.0</cell></row><row><cell>Rating</cell><cell>CVSS score range</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="04 - Flags" unique_id="320" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwes exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#ec5651">10 flags, 8 to pass
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Reviewers report 10 flags, with 8 needed to pass, </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">and</rich_text>
<rich_text> a report that passes.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">add rows as you find more</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 316" foreground="#ec5651">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
